om the terrace&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/house-from-beach.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;The house from the beach&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/garden-path.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Garden path to the sea&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/terrace.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Covered terrace with a dining table&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/living-room.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Living room&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-2/sofa.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Corner sofa&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-2/double-bedroom.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Double bedroom&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-4/dining-sea-view.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dining area with a view of the sea&quot;}]" data-start="6"><img src="/photos/sole-2/double-bedroom-sm.webp" srcset="/photos/sole-2/double-bedroom-sm.webp 640w, /photos/sole-2/double-bedroom.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 50vw, 320px" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>Double bedroom</span></button><button type="button" class="g8" data-slides="[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/sea-view.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;The sea from the terrace&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/house-from-beach.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;The house from the beach&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/garden-path.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Garden path to the sea&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/terrace.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Covered terrace with a dining table&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-1/living-room.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Living room&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-2/sofa.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Corner sofa&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-2/double-bedroom.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Double bedroom&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/photos/sole-4/dining-sea-view.webp&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dining area with a view of the sea&quot;}]" data-start="7"><img src="/photos/sole-4/dining-sea-view-sm.webp" srcset="/photos/sole-4/dining-sea-view-sm.webp 640w, /photos/sole-4/dining-sea-view.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 50vw, 320px" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>Dining area with a view of the sea</span></button></div></div><dialog id="lightbox"><div class="lb-stage"><button type="button" class="lb-nav lb-prev" aria-label="Previous photo">‹</button><img alt=""><button type="button" class="lb-nav lb-next" aria-label="Next photo">›</button></div><div class="lb-bar"><p></p><span class="lb-count"></span><form method="dialog"><button class="btn btn-sun">Close</button></form></div></dialog></section><section id="location"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Location</span><h2>Turanj, near Biograd na Moru</h2><p>A quiet coastal village in the Zadar region. The house sits right on the waterfront.</p></div><dl class="info"><dt>Address</dt><dd>Obala dr. Franje Tuđmana 25, Turanj, Croatia</dd><dt>To the sea</dt><dd>10 m</dd><dt>Parking</dt><dd>Free, 1 space per apartment</dd><dt>Boats</dt><dd>Mooring in front, trailer parking 50 m away</dd><dt>Check-in</dt><dd>from 14:00</dd><dt>Check-out</dt><dd>by 10:00</dd></dl><p><a class="btn btn-sun" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/BazAzpkz6CFHK8Ba7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Google Maps</a></p></div><iframe class="map" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=43.9721621,15.4030505&amp;z=16&amp;output=embed" title="Turanj, near Biograd na Moru" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div><figure class="wrap island"><img src="/photos/area/galesnjak.webp" srcset="/photos/area/galesnjak-sm.webp 800w, /photos/area/galesnjak.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" alt="Galešnjak, the world-famous heart-shaped island, lies just off Turanj." loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1200"><figcaption>Galešnjak, the world-famous heart-shaped island, lies just off Turanj.</figcaption></figure></section><section id="reviews" class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="reviews-top"><div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Guest reviews</span><h2>What our guests say</h2></div><a class="bk-badge" href="https://www.booking.com/hotel/hr/sole-apartments-turanj.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="bk-text"><b>Exceptional</b><small>84 guest reviews on Booking.com</small></span><span class="bk-score">9.6</span></a></div><div class="reviews"><figure class="review"><blockquote lang="en">“Fantastic apartment. Clean and tidy, inside there was everything you need and more.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Dominika</b>, Poland · Booking.com</figcaption></figure><figure class="review"><blockquote lang="en">“It is a great apartment right at the beach. The apartment is new and very well thought of in terms of facilities — you have everything you need.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Kseniya</b>, Netherlands · Booking.com</figcaption></figure><figure class="review"><blockquote lang="en">“Fantastic, beautiful location! … The balcony is very large and we loved sitting there as a family, enjoying the view.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Jackie</b>, Italy · Booking.com</figcaption></figure><figure class="review"><blockquote lang="en">“Beautiful, quiet location right by the sea. Sunbeds available by the sea. Spacious and comfortable living room. Nice terrace/balcony.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>G.</b>, Netherlands · Booking.com</figcaption></figure><figure class="review"><blockquote lang="en">“Quiet environment, almost by the sea, shops nearby, we liked it very much.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Adriana</b>, Slovakia · Booking.com</figcaption></figure></div><p class="reviews-more"><a href="https://www.booking.com/hotel/hr/sole-apartments-turanj.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>9.6/10</b> · 84 guest reviews on Booking.com →</a></p></div></section><section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap"><div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2>Good to know</h2></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I bring my pet?</summary><p>Unfortunately not. We do not accept pets.</p></details><details><summary>What is the beach like?</summary><p>The sea is 10 m from the house. The beach is sandy in the shallows; further out, the seabed is covered with seagrass and stones.</p></details><details><summary>How far are shops and restaurants?</summary><p>The nearest pizzeria is 200 m away, a shop 900 m, a restaurant 1 km and a large shopping centre 2.5 km. Biograd na Moru is 5 km away.</p></details><details><summary>Are bed linen and towels included?</summary><p>Yes, bed linen and towels are included.</p></details><details><summary>What are the check-in and check-out times?</summary><p>Check-in is from 14:00 and check-out is by 10:00.</p></details><details><summary>How do I book and pay?</summary><p>Send us an enquiry with your dates. A 30% deposit by bank transfer or Revolut confirms the booking; the rest is paid in cash. Tourist tax is included in the price.</p></details><details><summary>Is there parking?</summary><p>Yes. Each apartment has one free parking space in the courtyard.</p></details><details><summary>Can I bring my boat?</summary><p>Yes. There is a boat mooring in front of the house, and parking for boat trailers 50 m away.</p></details></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="band contact-band"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h2>Ask about your dates</h2><p>We reply by email or WhatsApp, usually the same day.</p><p class="direct-note"><b>Best price when you book directly.</b> Book directly with us, with no agency fees, and you always get our best price.</p></div><div class="direct"><div><span>WhatsApp / phone</span><b>+385 97 607 0998</b></div><div><span>Email</span><b>hi@sole.rentals</b></div><div><span>Address</span><b>Obala dr. Franje Tuđmana 25, Turanj, Croatia</b></div><div><span>Booking</span><b>30% deposit (bank transfer or Revolut), rest in cash</b></div><div><span>Tourist tax</span><b>Included</b></div></div></div><form action='/thanks/' class='enquiry-card' method='POST' name='enquiry'><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="enquiry"><input type="hidden" name="language" value="en"><h3 class="enquiry-title"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3zM3 7l9 6 9-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Ask for availability</h3><p hidden><label>Leave empty <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p><div class="row"><label>Name<input name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email"></label></div><div class="row"><label>Arrival<input name="arrival" id="arrival" class="date" placeholder="DD/MM/YYYY" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Departure<input name="departure" id="departure" class="date" placeholder="DD/MM/YYYY" autocomplete="off"></label></div><div class="row"><label>Apartment<select name="apartment" id="apartment"><option>Any</option><option data-id="sole-1" data-guests="4">Sole 1 (4 guests)</option><option data-id="sole-2" data-guests="4">Sole 2 (4 guests)</option><option data-id="sole-4" data-guests="2">Sole 4 (2 guests)</option></select></label><label>Guests<select name="guests" id="guests"><option>1</option><option selected>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select></label></div><label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="4"></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-sun" type="submit">Send enquiry</button><p class="form-note">We use your details only to answer your enquiry. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a></p></form></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><img class="foot-logo" src="/logo/sole-white.svg" alt="Sole" width="83" height="40" loading="lazy"><span>Sole Apartments · Turanj, Croatia<br>Obala dr. Franje Tuđmana 25, Turanj, Croatia</span><